  "updated_at": "2026-04-13",
  "bio": "\"Immerse yourself in the unparalleled artistry at Rabenschwarz Tattoo, nestled in the heart of Stein, Germany. Specializing in intricate dotwork and bold tribal designs, our studio is home to the distinct talents of @calinahain, @chris.battle.ttt, and @alina_sorg, who transform skin into canvas with precision and passion. Step into our creative sanctuary at Albertus-Magnus-Straße 2, where your personal vision becomes an indelible masterpiece.\"\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Stein, Bavaria, Germany\n\nSince 2013\n@calinahain + @chris.battle.ttt + @alina_sorg + @rob.bean_tt + @ink.wart.tattoo + @morast_tsarom + @jinu.ttt + @kikimora.tattoo",
